38705>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent Zoom from a Zoom.
38705>>>                Case Break
38706>>>
38706>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38706>>>
38706>>>        Case End
38706>>>
38706>>>        Send SetActionButtons
